<title>ARGENTINA: S.American presidents to discuss waterways project.</title>
<headline>S.American presidents to discuss waterways project.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's President Carlos Menem will host Uruguayan President Julio Sanguinetti and Paraguay's President Juan Carlos Wasmosy in Buenos Aires Tuesday, the state-run Telam news agency reported Monday.</p>
<p>The three presidents will discuss the progress of a project to improve waterways along the Paraguay and Parana rivers for shipping.</p>
<p>Sanguinetti and Wasmosy will return to their own countries the same day.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
